{
    "word": "cinchona",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "2ad8bcc8-b8a5-3c2d-b0e0-7870dfd4264e",
                "word": "cinchona",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "c76ac99e-435d-4280-8066-3aeb134a14aa",
                        "entry_id": "2ad8bcc8-b8a5-3c2d-b0e0-7870dfd4264e",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "cinchonas"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bd026048-815e-3b25-9b57-43a781919448",
                        "entry_id": "2ad8bcc8-b8a5-3c2d-b0e0-7870dfd4264e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A tree or shrub of the genus Cinchona, native to the Andes in South America but since widely cultivated in Indonesia and India as well for its medicinal bark."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "01bd02c1-bd51-48ff-a8d3-618662702ef3",
                                "sense_id": "bd026048-815e-3b25-9b57-43a781919448",
                                "text": "He seems to have collected plants of every kind - sugar-cane, coffee, cinchona, cocoa, indigo, and many others - and thus demonstrates beyond a doubt that Arnheim's Land will not prove herself behind the rest of the tropical world both in planting and agriculture, when the labour question is settled, and a properly-arranged coolie system enables planters to give the country a proper trial."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ead11322-2ba8-41e2-9eda-8088151bf930",
                                "sense_id": "bd026048-815e-3b25-9b57-43a781919448",
                                "text": "German chemists were the first to isolate pure drug chemicals from herbal medicines, with the isolation of morphine from crude opium in 1803 and quinine from the bark of the cinchona tree in 1820."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c0e33a58-bf79-31cc-81ab-ce268677f559",
                        "entry_id": "2ad8bcc8-b8a5-3c2d-b0e0-7870dfd4264e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The bark of these plants, which yield quinine and other alkaloids useful in reducing fevers and particularly in combatting malaria."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e51a865a-0152-3ad9-9925-6e9b7b9ae4ae",
                        "entry_id": "2ad8bcc8-b8a5-3c2d-b0e0-7870dfd4264e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Any medicine chiefly composed of the prepared bark of these plants."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "82e388f9-d418-4a04-b897-94f523c0c14e",
                        "source_entry_id": "2ad8bcc8-b8a5-3c2d-b0e0-7870dfd4264e",
                        "source_sense_description": "tree",
                        "target_lang_word": "quinquina",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "quinquina",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d079dffd-58ad-3bc1-982c-7b22c2f955d8",
                                        "entry_id": "509de4ed-4af3-3f3f-9490-f585982febb6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Écorce amère et fébrifuge qui est fournie par des arbres du genre Cinchona du Pérou."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Pharmacie"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b0d55780-2626-4706-a23f-94914d4dff02",
                                                "sense_id": "d079dffd-58ad-3bc1-982c-7b22c2f955d8",
                                                "text": "La poudre de quinquina mélangée de chaux, est agitée avec des huiles lourdes de pétrole qui dissolvent la quinine."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fa96ff89-9ce6-4583-bc5c-d9fb7a0892b9",
                                                "sense_id": "d079dffd-58ad-3bc1-982c-7b22c2f955d8",
                                                "text": "En tout cas, dans les débuts, le Roi, les princes, les visiteurs prenaient du quinquina avant d’aller contrôler les chantiers."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "779811d9-397e-32dd-91fc-bcf543d07a83",
                                        "entry_id": "509de4ed-4af3-3f3f-9490-f585982febb6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Vin dans lequel on fait macérer cette écorce."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3225ecea-b350-4bcc-890e-0486ce63511b",
                                                "sense_id": "779811d9-397e-32dd-91fc-bcf543d07a83",
                                                "text": "On lui a fait prendre du quinquina."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dfc106be-a6d5-4a6b-ba66-cf36c44fd72f",
                                                "sense_id": "779811d9-397e-32dd-91fc-bcf543d07a83",
                                                "text": "Vin de quinquina."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d82444d7-3777-4f84-8b21-6db28171f126",
                                                "sense_id": "779811d9-397e-32dd-91fc-bcf543d07a83",
                                                "text": "Sirop de quinquina."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a25a1e4c-1ef5-4ff0-a88a-9cf82a5f4f59",
                                                "sense_id": "779811d9-397e-32dd-91fc-bcf543d07a83",
                                                "text": "Quinquina rouge."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "06b1c04a-caca-4bef-9f9f-fb8ea6829168",
                                                "sense_id": "779811d9-397e-32dd-91fc-bcf543d07a83",
                                                "text": "Un verre de quinquina."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8245467a-895e-49e9-afeb-7e73d3d10776",
                                                "sense_id": "779811d9-397e-32dd-91fc-bcf543d07a83",
                                                "text": "« Porte cela chez le pharmacien, dit-il, celui qui est auprès de l’église, pas un autre. Tu donneras à ta mère le paquet nᵒ 1 ; tu lui feras boire d’heure en heure la potion nᵒ 2 ; le vin de quinquina en mangeant, car il faut qu’elle mange ; ce qu’elle voudra, surtout des œufs. Je reviendrai ce soir. »"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1f03b074-144d-45ab-9e14-105987ad920b",
                                                "sense_id": "779811d9-397e-32dd-91fc-bcf543d07a83",
                                                "text": "« Augustine, lui disait-elle j’ai trouvé la pauvre Une-Telle bien pâle sur sa porte. Vous lui apporterez demain une bouteille de mon vin de Bordeaux ou un rouleau de pièces de vingt sous pour qu’elle s’achète du quinquina. »"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "da7be5da-96a1-3e14-b251-10168001c19a",
                                        "entry_id": "509de4ed-4af3-3f3f-9490-f585982febb6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Arbre qui fournit cette écorce, il s’agit généralement du quinquina jaune (Cinchona calisaya)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ba8769c6-62da-4f08-b506-202d45ad9028",
                                                "sense_id": "da7be5da-96a1-3e14-b251-10168001c19a",
                                                "text": "Le fruit, les feuilles du quinquina."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "68c8ec0c-4fdc-42b2-945f-8cc24b630551",
